### Pruebas rápidas de la API (extensión REST Client de VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Listado (público) con filtros
GET {{base}}/stations?page=1&limit=5&search=hub&minPower=50&available=true&sort=power

### Ciudades
GET {{base}}/stations/cities

### Detalle inexistente → 404
GET {{base}}/stations/000000000000000000000000

### Crear sin sesión → 401
POST {{base}}/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test" }

### Login como admin (guarda la cookie de sesión)
POST {{base}}/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{ "email": "admin@voltmap.dev", "password": "Admin1234!" }

### Crear con datos inválidos → 400 con detalle
POST {{base}}/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "powerKw": "mucho", "connectorType": "USB" }

### Crear OK → 201
POST {{base}}/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estación de prueba",
  "operator": "VoltMap Labs",
  "city": "Buenos Aires",
  "address": "Av. Corrientes 1234",
  "connectorType": "CCS2",
  "powerKw": 120,
  "pricePerKwh": 400,
  "renewable": true,
  "open24h": false,
  "available": true,
  "installedAt": "2025-06-01"
}
